      "translations": {
        "en": "A man from the Ansar came to Abu Ja'far (peace be upon him) and said to him, 'I have been afflicted with a great matter. I had intercourse with my slave girl, then I went out for one of my needs, and on my return from the road, I found my slave between the legs of the slave girl. So I kept her away, and she became pregnant. Then I placed her in a waiting period of nine months.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَالَ لَهُ أَبُو جَعْفَرٍ ( عليه السلام ) احْبِسِ الْجَارِيَةَ لَا تَبِعْهَا وَ أَنْفِقْ عَلَيْهَا حَتَّى تَمُوتَ أَوْ يَجْعَلَ اللَّهُ لَهَا مَخْرَجاً فَإِنْ حَدَثَ بِكَ حَدَثٌ فَأَوْصِ بِأَنْ يُنْفَقَ عَلَيْهَا مِنْ مَالِكَ حَتَّى يَجْعَلَ اللَّهُ لَهَا مَخْرَجاً",
      "translations": {
        "en": "So Abu Ja'far (peace be upon him) said to him, 'Keep the slave girl; do not sell her, and spend upon her until she dies or Allah makes a way out for her. So if a death occurs to you, bequeath that she be spent upon from your wealth until Allah makes a way out for her.'"
